: \"In this report, data from 1998--1999 indicated that the incidence of early-onset GBS disease further declined in the surveillance areas\"}]}\n ],\n \"methods_quotes\": [\n  {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The incidence of early-onset disease was calculated using live birth data for 1997 from the National Center for Health Statistics.\"},\n  {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"surveillance staff reviewed prenatal GBS screening, risks for infection at the time of labor, receipt of intrapartum antibiotics, and infant outcome.\"},\n  {\"loc\": \"ocr\", \"q\": \"Denominator was sometimes <322 because of missing values.\"}\n ],\n \"confidence\": \"medium\",\n \"uncertain_fields\": [\"outcome_types\"]}", "type": "text"}]}